# The Testing Room: like sim/soccer under --game, but with a head camera per robot (MatchCameras), so every robot's
# player can see. The built-in GameController (module::Referee, --referee) announces the game and is operated by hand
# from the viewer or the browser; nothing is refereed automatically. ConsoleLog first so it captures startup logs.
k1sim_role(
  ConsoleLog
  Simulation
  SdkBridge
  Locomotion
  MatchCameras
  Supervisor
  Viewer
  WebViewer
  Referee
)
